        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OKAZU ~ A Relaxing Game Where You Count Fish ~ is a simple adventure game with easy controls and very clear rules, designed so even those unfamiliar with games can play with confidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players have only three tasks:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, explore the stage and touch key items that hold the story's mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Second, use the counter placed in the center of the screen to count the number of stimulating fish on the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third, escape alive from this imprisoned world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's greatest feature is its ‘Gentle Navigator’, who will guide you with kindness and care. Entrust yourself to the Navigator, and uncovering this world's truth will be easy. There is only one ending to the story, and playtime is about 1 hour, making it easy to enjoy. Rest assured, it will definitely be a bad ending.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Video Streaming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please check the official website.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 minutes to 60 minutes</p>",
